40":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1740904/35612197-dc42-4b48-8510-148962db7e3b.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1740904/35612197-dc42-4b48-8510-148962db7e3b.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1740904/35612197-dc42-4b48-8510-148962db7e3b.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Voll möblierte Studentenzimmer in modernen WGs in zentraler Lage von Gießen!\n\n️Zimmer & Wohnkomfort\nAlles neu: Erstbezug nach Komplettsanierung - voll möbliert mit\nBett, Matratze, Schreibtisch, Kleiderschrank & Regal.\n\nDeine Privatsphäre: Eigenes Waschbecken direkt im Zimmer.\n\nHotel-Feeling: regelmäßige kostenlose Reinigung der Gemeinschaftsräume.\n\n*Sorglos-Miete: ALL-IN alle Nebenkosten & flächendeckendem Highspeed-WLAN sind in der Monatsmiete mit inbegriffen. (keine versteckten Nachzahlungen!)\n\nTop-Lage in Gießen - Alicenstraße 32\n\nUltra zentral: ÖPNV, Uni & City direkt vor der Haustür\n\nKurze Wege zu Fuß:\n2–3 Min. zur Bushaltestelle\n5 Min. zur Innenstadt (Seltersweg)\n5–10 Min. zu JLU, Uniklinik & Hauptbahnhof\n10–15 Min. zum THM-Campus\n\nBike-friendly: Ausreichend Fahrradplätze draußen + überdachter abschließbarer Fahrradraum\n\nWG-Features & Highlights\n\n3 kleine WGs: Überschaubar mit 3-4 Personen pro WG\n\nSauber & stressfrei: 1x wöchentlich Reinigung der Gemeinschaftsräume inklusive\n\nGemeinschaftsküche: Voll ausgestattet mit Platz zum Kochen & Essen\n\nSmarte Extras: Fernseher inkl. Streamingdienste & Highspeed-WLAN überall\n\nOutdoors: Großer Garten zum Entspannen (dank Rasenmähroboter immer top gepflegt!)\n\nLaundry: Waschmaschine & Trockner im Keller für jedes Geschoss\n\nMiete & Kontakt\nAlles inklusive: Warmmiete ohne versteckte Nebenkosten (Strom, Heizung, WLAN etc. enthalten)\nBesichtigung auf Nachfrage.\n\nKontakt & Besichtigung\nDu hast Interesse an einem der Zimmer? Wir vereinbaren gerne einen flexiblen Besichtigungstermin mit dir!\n\nSchreib uns einfach eine Nachricht mit:\n1. Einer kurzen Vorstellung zu deiner Person\n2. Deiner Wunsch-Zimmernummer\n\n\n\nFully furnished student rooms in modern shared apartments in a central location in Giessen!\n\nRoom & Living Comfort\n\nEverything is brand new: First occupancy after complete renovation – fully furnished with a bed, mattress, desk, wardrobe, and shelf.\n\nYour privacy: Your own washbasin directly in your room.\n\nHotel-style comfort: Regular free cleaning of the shared areas.\n\nHassle-free rent: ALL-INCLUSIVE – all utilities and high-speed Wi-Fi throughout the property are included in the monthly rent. No hidden additional charges!\n\nPrime Location in Giessen – Alicenstraße 32\n\nSuper central: Public transport, university, and the city centre are right on your doorstep.\n\nEverything within walking distance:\n\n2–3 minutes to the bus stop\n5 minutes to the city centre / Seltersweg\n5–10 minutes to JLU, University Hospital, and the main train station\n10–15 minutes to the THM campus\n\nBike-friendly: Plenty of outdoor bicycle parking plus a covered, lockable bicycle storage room.\n\nShared Apartment Features & Highlights\n\n3 small shared apartments: Comfortable and manageable, with only 3–4 people per apartment.\n\nClean & stress-free: Weekly cleaning of the shared areas is included.\n\nShared kitchen: Fully equipped with plenty of space for cooking and dining.\n\nSmart extras: TV including streaming services and high-speed Wi-Fi throughout the property.\n\nOutdoor space: Large garden for relaxing – always well maintained thanks to a robotic lawn mower!\n\nLaundry: Washing machine and dryer in the basement for each floor.\n\nRent\n\nEverything included: Warm rent with no hidden utility costs. Electricity, heating, Wi-Fi, etc. are all included.\n\nViewings are available upon request.\n\nContact & Viewings\n\nInterested in one of the rooms? We would be happy to arrange a flexible viewing appointment with you!\n\nSimply send us a message including:\n\n-A short introduction about yourself\n-Your preferred room number\n","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"shared"},"basement":{"value":"shared"},"bathroom":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomSize":{"value":"12"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"no"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"other"},"garden":{"value":"shared"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"gas"},"housematesGender":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"shared"},"kitchenware":{"value":"shared"},"livingRoom":{"value":"shared"},"parking":{"value":"shared"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"yes"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"no"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"tenantStatus":{"value":"students only"},"toilet":{"value":"shared"},"totalSize":{"value":"12"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":54000,"deposit":0,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"540.00","deposit":"0.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":6,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":3,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-09-18"}],"updated":"2026-09-18T09:37:03Z","__utId__":"ut1740904"}]